  "summary": "The Iranian city of Isfahan has long been one of the centres for production of the famous Persian carpet (or rug).",
  "description": "The Iranian city of Isfahan has long been one of the centres for production of the famous Persian carpet (or rug). Isfahani carpets are renowned for their high quality. The most famous workshop in Isfahan is Seirafian. In Europe, they became incorrectly known as Polish rugs (a la polonaise) because of the trade route from Persia to France running through Poland.",
